					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ldocd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6247804); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6247804&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609831935" alt="LDoCD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6247804)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ldocd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6247804); return false;" >LDoCD</a></span> <span class="odate time_1585958624 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">04 Apr 2020 00:03</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4580580">
									

<p>Threat entity report of humanoid rocks located in Arunachal Pradesh. GOC agents are sent in to eliminate them amidst a border dispute between India and China. The team is comprised of these two nations.</p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Other (GOC Entry)</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Political Drama</p>
<strong>Summary:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>A threat entity database entry about a family of four sentient humanoid rocks living in a cave on a side of a mountainous plateau located in Arunachal Pradesh. The GOC agents are sent in to eliminate them amidst the background of a border dispute between India and China. The team sent in are from a local mixed national strike force comprising both China and India. Will these agents from opposing sides work together to eliminate a threat despite the tensions between their homelands? Or will another force get to them first?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The core idea of this story is to highlight the <strong>UNITED NATIONS</strong> part of the <strong>UNITED NATIONS</strong> Global Occult Coalition. This is to ask the question of how would the GOC function in reality when presented with infighting? Will the GOC work together nicely despite the rivalry of nations or will they bicker amongst themselves?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<strong>Central Narrative:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>A border dispute happened between China and India over Arunachal Pradesh. The GOC is sent in to surveillance and eliminate any threat entities in case a conflict were to break out. Too many cameras and recording devices nowadays to ensure perfect normality. If there were a threat entity and a conflict broke out in that location, who knows what will happen if journalists and reporters sneak in. So a sweep of the area was conducted and they’ve found a family of threat entities living on a mountainous plateau in a cave. However, the team that was sent to eliminate the entities were from both India and China. Mutual distrust and purposeful racism is made clear as they try to take out a target to the dismay of a Chinese American living in India that’s currently leading the squad. Will they be able to take out the target despite their differences and the hostile political climate? Or will some different organization handle the entity first?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<strong>Hook:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The United Nations is a coalition of many nations working together to maintain world peace. The Global Occult Coalition is an organization founded by them. However, not all members like each other. What would happen when a team composed of two of these nations that hates each other are sent on a mission in the background of their heated political dispute?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

