<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<strong>Conclusion:</strong> There's a lot of things going on now, that the story becomes very complicated and convoluted. You need to realign your focus on what matters, which is the team.</p>
<p>Additionally, I would suggest you go online and learn about how to handle/facilitate discussions, and how to create win-win situations out of problems, so as to give your article a more solid feel and credibility.</p>
<p>Once you have made the adjustments, or you have any questions, feel free to reach out to me on Wikidot PM or on IRC chat.</p>

